{"request_id":"sha256:11f7d6987b7c4e88ece773c5323bb3e178557386f713eeddbbfc4aef211c5433","units":[{"unit_id":"sha256:b310efaf23ffc795abfa6e1ffd47d0b90d24cdea5182ce7ab1036ff0e9320e8c","reviewed":true,"findings":[{"kind":"AVAILABLE_CAPACITY","subject":"TARGET_REGISTRANT","timing":"CURRENT_REPORT","evidence":[{"kind":"VISIBLE_BLOCK","source_index":809,"text":"These arrangements maintained a combined manufacturing capacity of approximately five-million microinverters per quarter."}],"reason":"Enphase Energy, Inc. combined manufacturing capacity (in-house facility plus Flex partnership) of approximately five million microinverters per quarter, maintained during fiscal year 2025 (period ended December 31, 2025). Quarterly capacity figure; not annualized."},{"kind":"CAPACITY_QUALITATIVE","subject":"TARGET_REGISTRANT","timing":"CURRENT_REPORT","evidence":[{"kind":"VISIBLE_BLOCK","source_index":834,"text":"We believe our contract manufacturing partners have sufficient production capacity to meet the anticipated demand for our products for the foreseeable future."}],"reason":"Qualitative statement that third-party contract manufacturing partners have sufficient production capacity to meet anticipated demand; no comparable actual-output/capacity pair disclosed. Subject is Enphase Energy, Inc. and its contract manufacturing arrangements; timing is current report (fiscal year 2025)."},{"kind":"SALES_OR_SHIPMENTS","subject":"TARGET_REGISTRANT","timing":"CURRENT_REPORT","evidence":[{"kind":"VISIBLE_BLOCK","source_index":883,"text":"During the year ended December 31, 2025, we sold approximately 6.4 million microinverter units and shipped 706.1 MWh of IQ Batteries, as compared to approximately 6.5 million microinverter units and 521 MWh of IQ Batteries shipped in the year ended December 31, 2024."}],"reason":"Microinverter units sold (approximately 6.4 million) and IQ Batteries shipped (706.1 MWh) for the year ended December 31, 2025; these are sales/shipment quantities, not actual production. Prior-year comparative (6.5 million units; 521 MWh) also shipments."},{"kind":"SALES_OR_SHIPMENTS","subject":"TARGET_REGISTRANT","timing":"CURRENT_REPORT","evidence":[{"kind":"VISIBLE_BLOCK","source_index":804,"text":"As of December 31, 2025, we have shipped approximately 86.4 million microinverters, and more than 5.1 million Enphase residential and commercial systems have been deployed in over 160 countries."}],"reason":"Cumulative microinverters shipped (approximately 86.4 million) and systems deployed (more than 5.1 million) as of December 31, 2025; shipment/deployment figures, not actual production."},{"kind":"OTHER_CONTEXT","subject":"TARGET_REGISTRANT","timing":"CURRENT_REPORT","evidence":[{"kind":"VISIBLE_BLOCK","source_index":806,"text":"scaling U.S. manufacturing and advancing product qualification to take advantage of both the Section 48E investment tax credit and the AMPTC under Section 45X of the Code"}],"reason":"Narrative description of fiscal year 2025 priorities including scaling U.S. manufacturing; no production or capacity quantity disclosed."},{"kind":"OTHER_CONTEXT","subject":"TARGET_REGISTRANT","timing":"CURRENT_REPORT","evidence":[{"kind":"VISIBLE_BLOCK","source_index":818,"text":"We have relocated a significant portion of our manufacturing to the United States while continuing to utilize contract manufacturing in China and India."}],"reason":"Contextual statement about relocation of manufacturing footprint and continued contract manufacturing in China and India; no production or capacity quantity."},{"kind":"OTHER_CONTEXT","subject":"TARGET_REGISTRANT","timing":"CURRENT_REPORT","evidence":[{"kind":"VISIBLE_BLOCK","source_index":819,"text":"identifying qualified suppliers with the necessary expertise and capacity remains challenging"}],"reason":"Statement about supplier capacity for LFP battery cells being challenging; refers to supplier qualification, not Enphase manufacturing capacity or actual production."},{"kind":"OTHER_CONTEXT","subject":"TARGET_REGISTRANT","timing":"CURRENT_REPORT","evidence":[{"kind":"VISIBLE_BLOCK","source_index":986,"text":"we had open purchase obligations of $252.3 million related to component inventory that we and our primary contract manufacturers procure on our behalf in accordance with our production forecast"}],"reason":"Open purchase obligations tied to production forecast; monetary purchase commitment, not production quantity or manufacturing capacity."},{"kind":"OTHER_CONTEXT","subject":"TARGET_REGISTRANT","timing":"CURRENT_REPORT","evidence":[{"kind":"VISIBLE_BLOCK","source_index":737,"text":"Manufacturing facility and warehouse facilityArlington, U.S.Leased227,344Jan-2031"}],"reason":"Principal properties table listing Arlington, U.S. manufacturing facility and warehouse (227,344 sq ft, leased through Jan-2031); facility square footage, not production output or manufacturing capacity."},{"kind":"OTHER_CONTEXT","subject":"TARGET_REGISTRANT","timing":"CURRENT_REPORT","evidence":[{"kind":"VISIBLE_BLOCK","source_index":830,"text":"AMTPC earned under the IRA for U.S. manufactured microinverters shipped to customers are treated as a reduction to cost of revenues."}],"reason":"Reference to U.S. manufactured microinverters in the context of AMPTC tax credit accounting; no production or capacity quantity."},{"kind":"OTHER_CONTEXT","subject":"TARGET_REGISTRANT","timing":"CURRENT_REPORT","evidence":[{"kind":"VISIBLE_BLOCK","source_index":899,"text":"benefits recognized from tax credits under the AMPTC for U.S. manufactured microinverters and IQ Batteries MWh shipped to customers"}],"reason":"AMPTC tax credit benefit discussion referencing U.S. manufactured microinverters and IQ Batteries shipped; monetary tax credit amounts, not production or capacity quantities."}],"unresolved":["Whether the approximately five-million microinverters per quarter combined manufacturing capacity (source_index 809) represents nameplate versus achievable capacity, and whether it applies to microinverters only or also to batteries, is not specified in the source."]}]}